## 3️⃣ Add a simple stylesheet

Create (or append to) `src/Settings.css`:

```css
/* ---------- Dark‑mode toggle ---------- */
.toggle-wrapper {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  margin: 1.5rem 0;
}

.toggle-label {
  font-weight: 600;
}

.toggle-btn {
  background: none;
  border: 1px solid currentColor;
  border-radius: 9999px;
  padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
}
.toggle-btn.on {
  background: #222;
  color: #fff;
}
.toggle-btn.off {
  background: #eee;
  color: #222;
}

/* ---------- Save button ---------- */
.save-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background-color: #007bff;
  color: #fff;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s ease;
}
.save-btn:hover {
  background-color: #0056b3;
}

/* ---------- Mobile fix: ensure button fits full width ----- */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .save-btn {
    width: 100%;
  }
}
```

