## 4️⃣ Optional: Use the theme in your CSS

```css
/* Example: highlight dark mode */
[data-theme="dark"] .settings-container {
  background: #1e1e1e;
  color: #fff;
}
[data-theme="dark"] .save-btn {
  background-color: #444;
}
[data-theme="dark"] .save-btn:hover {
  background-color: #666;
}
```

If you already have a global CSS that defines light‑mode styles, just extend it with the `[data-theme="dark"]` rules above.

